# OneAttendance — React Native Project

**App**: Employee attendance management (punch in/out, leave, admin management).
**Stack**: React Native 0.85, React 19, TypeScript, React Navigation 7, Axios, i18next.

## Directory Structure

```
src/
├── api/            # API functions (authHttpClient + endpoint wrappers)
├── components/     # Shared components (modals/, icons/, MainTopBar)
├── context/        # AuthContext, ThemeContext
├── hooks/          # Custom hooks (useAttendanceList, useUpdateProfile, etc.)
├── i18n/           # i18next setup
├── locales/        # Translation files (en.ts, hi.ts, ta.ts, te.ts, etc.)
├── navigation/     # Navigators + route type definitions
├── screens/        # Screen components grouped by feature
├── storage/        # AsyncStorage wrappers (auth, theme, language)
├── theme/          # palettes.ts (AppThemeColors: light + dark)
├── types/          # TypeScript type definitions per domain
└── utils/          # Pure utility/helper functions
```

## Import Alias

Use `@src/` for all project imports: `import { foo } from '@src/api/attendanceApi'`
Configured via `tsconfig.json` paths + `babel.config.js` module-resolver.

## Key Conventions

- Functional components only — no class components
- `StyleSheet.create()` via a `buildStyles(colors, scheme)` factory
- All text user-facing → i18next translation keys
- API calls through `authHttpClient` (Axios instance with Bearer token)
- Company-scoped endpoints send `company: <id>` custom header
- Types in `src/types/`, one file per domain
